\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rtej6VDOxa4Q7kNvwGlsS0H&_nc_oc=AdrFP5R-I8TjdmF3F8Z11WN5JMJwvUfsAFrBby4Ye02D8pQkQV54PVbBh9SaCNeY8lQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxiG_JSw84hb0bptSAZ5yFKtahK6GCBJzWtuTovrV0dIg&oe=69C12274"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iicLN45GFEgQ7kNvwGbugsH&_nc_oc=Adr95iYiwoy_xI8uzx6tvSDqByI7WdkV4AqF7TL8XTbGPZbOzu2COjrsMH_3r1wwAKE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzKHnytc7EBCLK-AuEFLU-qGXCMgDAuAY8MiHRPMmKTdg&oe=69C123D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RQwzhtU-eoYQ7kNvwFzb3ky&_nc_oc=AdrHRJIAJ3z6_p2k207ynVBXpVsugghXdtne4wl80WSf83nht0Aw2WwHOA7DjNQaR-g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyqGH3oTy5jzxU5ljGUdiij6QvL3B8CmNv1hMfIMs3zqQ&oe=69C138F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771